{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1060919/block/singleImage/3252010/df/01M62XXK6GFYHJ94BRY69WT8J8.png?updatedAt=1793247417\"/><figcaption>觀塘工廈業主收回單位，揭20龜2蜥蜴等動物斃命。(Google街景截圖)</figcaption></figure><p>今日 (29 日 ) 上午 10 時 39 分，警方接獲一名女子報案，指觀塘成業工業大廈單位發現有大量龜、魚和蜥蜴斃命，但租客不知所終。警員到場，經調查後列作「殘酷對待動物」跟進，並正追查涉事租客的下落。 現場消息稱，女業主在執達主任協助下到來收樓，發現大量爬蟲類動物死亡，初步點算有 20 隻龜、兩隻蜥蝪和兩條魚。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T05:41:29.855746+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":195,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T04:16:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T07:38:21.870394+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T05:38:20.111462+00:00","content_hash":"3326db0e97e5476aec196e612840f4f0d45769d6c46ab58bea947843c4939a87","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}